# Email delivery for the "Request an Offer" form (Web3Forms).
#
# 1. Go to https://web3forms.com -> enter nikitas2052@gmail.com -> you get an Access Key.
# 2. Put that key below (and in Vercel: Project Settings -> Environment Variables).
# 3. WEB3FORMS_CC is the SECOND inbox that also receives every request.
#
# After setting these in Vercel, redeploy for them to take effect.

WEB3FORMS_ACCESS_KEY=your-web3forms-access-key-here
WEB3FORMS_CC=vinfoliowines@gmail.com
